es VitalConnect in a $237.5M deal [45, 46].\n\nAlso worth knowing:\n- Fathom, Bed Bath & Beyond Parent Merger Is Called Off [47].\n- OpenAI in talks with UAE funds to anchor $30 bln funding round [48].\n- Norlee Group Acquires IEM Electric in Eighth Add-On Deal [49].",
